Multi-Arch: foreign
Homepage: https://github.com/ardagnsrn/ollama-php
Description: PHP client library for Ollama
 Ollama is an open-source platform for running large language models
 on the local machine. This library provides a PHP client for the
 Ollama API with support for chat, completions, embeddings, streaming
 and model management.
